msgctxt "#30035"
msgid "Clear Kodi's cached copies of the thumbnails of plain video files (Videos > Files)?[CR]Kodi then reads those thumbnail files again, e.g. after you replaced a -thumb.jpg yourself. Library thumbnails and the image files are not touched."
